        "text": "1. $1/C_{T} = (1/200) + (1/600)$ $C_{T} = 150 \\, \\mu\\text{F}$"
      },
      {
        "mark": "A1",
        "text": "2. $Q = CV$ $= 150 \\times 10^{-6} \\times 12$ or $600 \\times 10^{-6} \\times 3.0$ or $200 \\times 10^{-6} \\times 9.0$ $= 1.8 \\times 10^{-3} \\text{C}$"
      },
      {
        "mark": "A1",
        "text": "3. $V = Q/C = 1.8 \\times 10^{-3} / 600 \\times 10^{-6}$ or $V = [200/(200 + 600)] \\times 12$ $= 3(.0) \\text{V}$"
